<title>USA: Omaha hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $0.25 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $0.25 lower.</p>
<p>Top $59.00 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3   230-270 lbs    58.50-59.00, mostly 59.00</p>
<p>US  2-3   270-290 lbs    57.50-58.50</p>
<p>Sows: 20 percent. Steady to 0.50 lower. Top 48.50.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-500 lbs    47.50</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-550 lbs    48.00</p>
<p>	    550-650 lbs    48.50</p>
</text>
